LangString InstallApplication ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在为您的用户安装 SDrive..."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Close SDrive in all Windows sessions using Exit safely, then choose Retry to continue uninstalling."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Feche o SDrive em todas as sessões do Windows usando Sair com segurança e clique em Tentar novamente para continuar a desinstalação."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_SPANISH} "Cierre SDrive en todas las sesiones de Windows usando Salir de forma segura, luego elija Reintentar para continuar con la desinstalación."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_FRENCH} "Fermez SDrive dans toutes les sessions Windows en utilisant Quitter en toute sécurité, puis choisissez Réessayer pour continuer la désinstallation."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_GERMAN} "Schließen Sie SDrive in allen Windows-Sitzungen mit „Sicher beenden“ und wählen Sie dann „Wiederholen“, um mit der Deinstallation fortzufahren."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Chiudi SDrive in tutte le sessioni di Windows utilizzando Esci in sicurezza, quindi scegli Riprova per continuare la disinstallazione."
LangString UninstallRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "使用“安全退出”关闭所有 Windows 会话中的 SDrive，然后选择“重试”继续卸载。"
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Could not remove SDrive's Explorer icons. If needed, open SDrive, turn off service icons and exit safely. Choose Retry to try again."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Não foi possível remover os ícones do SDrive no Explorador. Se necessário, abra o SDrive, desative os ícones dos serviços e saia com segurança. Clique em Tentar novamente."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_SPANISH} "No se pudieron eliminar los íconos del Explorador de SDrive. Si es necesario, abra SDrive, desactive los iconos de servicio y salga de forma segura. Elija Reintentar para volver a intentarlo."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_FRENCH} "Impossible de supprimer les icônes de l'Explorateur de SDrive. Si nécessaire, ouvrez SDrive, désactivez les icônes de service et quittez en toute sécurité. Choisissez Réessayer pour réessayer."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_GERMAN} "Die Explorer-Symbole von SDrive konnten nicht entfernt werden. Öffnen Sie bei Bedarf SDrive, deaktivieren Sie die Dienstsymbole und beenden Sie das Programm sicher. Wählen Sie „Wiederholen“, um es noch einmal zu versuchen."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Impossibile rimuovere le icone Explorer di SDrive. Se necessario, apri SDrive, disattiva le icone di servizio ed esci in sicurezza. Scegli Riprova per riprovare."
LangString UninstallIconsFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法删除 SDrive 的资源管理器图标。如果需要，打开SDrive，关闭服务图标并安全退出。选择重试以重试。"
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Could not remove $3. Close applications using it or resolve the access problem, then choose Retry."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Não foi possível remover $3. Feche os aplicativos que usam esse caminho ou resolva o problema de acesso e clique em Tentar novamente."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_SPANISH} "No se pudo eliminar $3. Cierre las aplicaciones que lo utilizan o resuelva el problema de acceso, luego elija Reintentar."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_FRENCH} "Impossible de supprimer $3. Fermez les applications qui l'utilisent ou résolvez le problème d'accès, puis choisissez Réessayer."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_GERMAN} "$3 konnte nicht entfernt werden. Schließen Sie Anwendungen, die es verwenden, oder beheben Sie das Zugriffsproblem und wählen Sie dann „Wiederholen“."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Impossibile rimuovere $3. Chiudi le applicazioni che lo utilizzano o risolvi il problema di accesso, quindi scegli Riprova."
LangString UninstallRemoveFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法删除 $3。关闭使用它的应用程序或解决访问问题，然后选择“重试”。"
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The installation directory does not match SDrive's registry entry."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "A pasta de instalação não corresponde ao registro do SDrive."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_SPANISH} "El directorio de instalación no coincide con la entrada del registro de SDrive."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_FRENCH} "Le répertoire d'installation ne correspond pas à l'entrée de registre de SDrive."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_GERMAN} "Das Installationsverzeichnis stimmt nicht mit dem Registrierungseintrag von SDrive überein."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_ITALIAN} "La directory di installazione non corrisponde alla voce di registro di SDrive."
LangString UninstallDirectoryMismatch ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装目录与 SDrive 的注册表项不匹配。"
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Could not remove SDrive's Windows registration. Resolve the registry access problem, then choose Retry."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "Não foi possível remover o registro do SDrive no Windows. Resolva o problema de acesso ao registro e clique em Tentar novamente."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_SPANISH} "No se pudo eliminar el registro de Windows de SDrive. Resuelva el problema de acceso al registro y luego elija Reintentar."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_FRENCH} "Impossible de supprimer l'enregistrement Windows de SDrive. Résolvez le problème d'accès au registre, puis choisissez Réessayer."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_GERMAN} "Die Windows-Registrierung von SDrive konnte nicht entfernt werden. Beheben Sie das Registrierungszugriffsproblem und wählen Sie dann „Wiederholen“."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Impossibile rimuovere la registrazione Windows di SDrive. Risolvi il problema di accesso al registro, quindi scegli Riprova."
LangString UninstallRegistryFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法删除 SDrive 的 Windows 注册。解决注册表访问问题，然后选择“重试”。"
